{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S01、S06 等段落纵向交替的信息层次较多，视线需要反复上下移动，不如 X 的左右双栏容易一眼扫全。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用【】高亮让每段心理转折的落点更容易被抓住，感受又能随音乐具体小节出现，减少了静态堆放的感觉。尤其 S09-S12，Y 更清楚地呈现了他从舍不得亲近、害怕孤单，到不愿再忍受委屈、尝试自己生活的心理变化；S13 也没有把结尾简单处理成下定决心，而是保留了希望、兴奋、迟疑和接受现实的层次。X 的固定双栏确实更容易快速扫读，但部分音乐变化和心理细节被压缩成概括性词组，前后转折的具体过程不如 Y 清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "647bd676-489f-4fee-8f2d-f6bd44b2e3a1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005406104571Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:55:03.586887+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "abf607c90931bd0a2796ba21334309c5729998eb5f09a0c2562a70060cfc50c1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 